Date: Fri, 8 May 2026 19:53:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add upload receipts, idempotency headers, JSON-500 middleware
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Implements four of the items from `docs/signbank-api-recommendations.md`
in the upstream `signCollect-v2` project:

* §1  Upload receipts on api_update_gloss/{glossid}/video and /image
* §2  Idempotency via If-None-Match: * and If-Match: <sha256> headers
* §5  Middleware that converts uncaught exceptions on /dictionary/api_*
      paths into a JSON 500 instead of an 8 KB HTML page
* §9  api_delete_gloss empty-body handling already covered by previous
      commit; this also adds JSON-shaped error response on 412

Files added:
* signbank/api_receipts.py    — sha256/file_summary helpers + receipt
                                 builder + idempotency-header parser
* signbank/api_middleware.py  — JsonErrorMiddleware

Files changed:
* signbank/api_interface.py   — api_add_video and api_add_image now
                                 - hash incoming payload before save() consumes it,
                                 - compute and return previous-file summary,
                                 - honor If-None-Match / If-Match headers,
                                 - return a unified receipt object instead of
                                   a one-line message.
* signbank/settings/base.py   — registers JsonErrorMiddleware as the last
                                 middleware in the chain.

Receipt example (api_update_gloss/{glossid}/video):
{
  "ok": true,
  "message": "Uploaded 1 videos to dataset NGT.",
  "gloss_id": 1,
  "kind": "video",
  "uploaded_at": "2026-05-08T19:52:50Z",
  "uploaded_by": "gomer",
  "sha256": "40bcc8fb…", "size_bytes": 1715,
  "stored_filename": "UPLOADTEST-1.mp4",
  "stored_path": "/.../glossvideo/NGT/UP/UPLOADTEST-1.mp4",
  "stored_size_bytes": 1715, "stored_sha256": "40bcc8fb…",
  "replaced": {
    "filename": "UPLOADTEST-1.mp4",
    "sha256": "2e54708d…", "size_bytes": 1877,
    "uploaded_at": "2026-05-08T19:52:20Z",
    "stored_path": "/.../glossvideo/NGT/UP/UPLOADTEST-1.mp4"
  },
  "nr_of_videos": 1, "label": "file"
}

The legacy "{message: …}" shape is still returned when the upload
contained only side-camera (left / right) videos and no center video,
to avoid breaking existing callers of the multi-camera path.

Items §3 (per-gloss media history endpoint), §4 (consistent error shape
across every endpoint), §6 (field-name canonicalization), §7 (gloss
search endpoint), §10 (canonical datetime format), and §11 (webhooks)
are intentionally deferred — they require either DB schema changes,
new endpoints with their own URL/permission story, or design decisions
better made by the upstream maintainers.
